                0.185,
                0.137,
                0.814,
                0.186
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、【2024 武汉工程大学 4.4】设系统输入信号为 \\(x(t)\\), 输出信号为 \\(y(t)\\), 因果LTI 系统的微分方程如下: \\(y''(t) + \\frac{3}{2} y'(t) + \\frac{1}{2} y(t) = 5x(t)\\), 已知 \\(y(0^-) = 1\\), \\(y'(0^-) =\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.193,
                0.384,
                0.212
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "0, \\(x(t) = e^{-3t}u(t)\\), 求:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.218,
                0.395,
                0.236
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1) 求零输入响应 \\( y_{zi}(t) \\);",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.242,
                0.397,
                0.261
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 求零状态响应 \\( y_{zs}(t) \\) ;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.195,
                0.267,
                0.351,
                0.285
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3) 求全响应 \\( y(t) \\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.451,
                0.186,
                0.81,
                0.245
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解: \\(\\alpha^{2}+\\frac{3}{2}\\alpha+\\frac{1}{2}=(\\alpha+1)(\\alpha+\\frac{1}{2})=0\\) \\(\\alpha_{1}=-1, \\quad \\alpha_{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.486,
                0.246,
                0.933,
                0.763
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)  \\( y_{2i}|t| = Ae^{-t} + Be^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} \\) \n\n \\( y_{2i}(t+1) = y_{10-1} = A + B = 1 \\) \n\n \\( y_{2i}(t+1) = y_{10-1} = -A - \\frac{1}{2}B = 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} A = -1 \\\\ B = 2 \\end{cases} \\) \n\n \\( \\therefore y_{2i}(t) = (-e^{-t} + 2e^{-\\frac{1}{2}t})u(t) \\) \n\n(2)  \\( y_{2sh}(t) = Ce^{-t} + De^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} \\) \n\n \\( 5x(t) = 5e^{-3t}u(t) \\)  自由项\n\n \\( t > 0 \\)  时自由项  \\( = 5e^{-3t} \\) ，故  \\( y_{2xp}(t) = Ee^{-3t} \\) \n\n \\( 9Ee^{-3t} - \\frac{9}{2}Ee^{-3t} + \\frac{9}{2}e^{-3t} = 5e^{-3t} \\) \n\nE = 1\n\n \\( y_{xp}(t) = e^{-3t} \\) \n\n \\( y_{x}(t) = Ce^{-t} + De^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} + e^{-3t} \\) \n\n自由项中无  \\( \\delta(t) \\)  或  \\( \\delta(t) \\)  参际项，故无初始化\n\n即  \\( y_{x}(t+1) = y_{x}(t-1) = C + D + 1 = 0 \\) \n\n \\( y'_{x}(t+1) = y'_{x}(t-1) = -C - \\frac{1}{2}D - 3 = 0 \\) \n\n \\( \\Rightarrow C = -5, D = 4 \\) \n\n \\( \\Rightarrow y_{x}(t) = (-5e^{-t} + 4e^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} + e^{-3t})u(t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.466,
                0.767,
                0.841,
                0.84
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(3)} & {y | t | = y _ {2 i} | t | + y _ {x} | t |} \\\\ & {= (- 6 e ^ {- t} + 6 e ^ {- \\frac {1}{2} t} + e ^ {- 3 t}) (u | t)} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
