            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3、【2024重庆大学6.2】已知某LTI系统, \\( y''(t)+5y'(t)+6y(t)=x''(t)+3x'(t)+ \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.183,
                0.134,
                0.805,
                0.151
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(2x(t)\\) ，已知 \\(x(t) = 3(1 + e^{-t})u(t)\\) ，其中全响应 \\(y(t) = (4e^{-2t} + 3e^{-3t} + 1)u(t)\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.162,
                0.557,
                0.179
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求：求 \\( y(0^{-}) \\) ， \\( y'(0^{-}) \\) 。（请用时域方法求解）",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.19,
                0.225,
                0.208
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "【解析】",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.142,
                0.224,
                0.221,
                0.24
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "由输入:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.425,
                0.255,
                0.613,
                0.272
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx (t) = 3 \\left(1 + e ^ {- t}\\right) u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.14,
                0.285,
                0.241,
                0.303
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求一阶导：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.278,
                0.319,
                0.759,
                0.338
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx ^ {\\prime} (t) = 3 \\delta (t) - 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} \\cdot \\delta (t) = 6 \\delta (t) - 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.14,
                0.35,
                0.241,
                0.368
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求二阶导：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.258,
                0.383,
                0.779,
                0.403
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.141,
                0.416,
                0.178,
                0.433
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "则：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.145,
                0.448,
                0.89,
                0.501
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{c} x ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 x ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 x (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t) + 1 8 \\delta (t) - 9 e ^ {- t t} u (t) + 6 (1 + e ^ {- t}) u (t) \\\\ = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 1 5 \\delta (t) + 6 u (t) \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.141,
                0.513,
                0.178,
                0.53
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "设：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.35,
                0.546,
                0.687,
                0.612
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} y ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\delta (t) + c \\Delta u (t) \\\\ y ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta (t) + b \\Delta u (t) \\\\ y (t) = a \\Delta u (t) \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.141,
                0.625,
                0.199,
                0.642
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "得到：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.184,
                0.658,
                0.852,
                0.71
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{c} y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 5 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 y (t) = a \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\delta (t) + c \\Delta u (t) + 5 a \\delta (t) + 5 b \\Delta u (t) + 6 a \\Delta u (t) \\\\ = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 1 5 \\delta (t) + 6 u (t) \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.14,
                0.723,
                0.2,
                0.74
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解得：",
